{
  "_comment": "规则中心 · 全局参数。规则源清单在 upstreams.txt（一行一个地址，加减规则只改那个文件）。",
  "version": 5,
  "cdnBase": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/A11255/flclash-ruleset@main",
  "_upstreamComment": "规则源已迁到 upstreams.txt。本文件不再保存 upstream 数组，避免两份真相。数组顺序即优先级，由 upstreams.txt 的行序决定。",
  "_openclashComment": "OpenClash 端的三张大表（Direct_Rule / Proxy_Rule / Adblock4limbo 的部分）用 openclash:off 排除，原因：路由器加载 48 万条规则会在第五步卡死。openclash:off 写在 upstreams.txt 对应行的行尾。",
  "guardRules": [
    "GEOIP,LAN,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR,127.0.0.0/8,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR,192.168.0.0/16,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR,10.0.0.0/8,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR,172.16.0.0/12,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR,169.254.0.0/16,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR,100.66.1.0/24,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR,100.64.0.0/10,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR6,::1/128,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR6,fc00::/7,DIRECT,no-resolve",
    "IP-CIDR6,fe80::/10,DIRECT,no-resolve"
  ],
  "tailRules": [
    "GEOIP,CN,DIRECT"
  ],
  "fakeIpFilterExtra": [
    "+.lan",
    "+.local",
    "+.localdomain",
    "+.home.arpa",
    "+.msftconnecttest.com",
    "+.msftncsi.com",
    "localhost.ptlogin2.qq.com"
  ],
  "tunExcludeExtra": [
    "100.64.0.0/10"
  ],
  "_policyMapComment": "各端用自己的出站习惯，互不通用。flclash 用订阅里的策略组名（已在 config.yaml 中确认存在）；loon 用内建 PROXY，指向当前选中节点，不依赖任何自定义组名；openclash 必须填路由器上真实存在的组名，改订阅模板后要同步改这里。",
  "policyMap": {
    "flclash": {
      "PROXY": "节点选择",
      "DIRECT": "DIRECT",
      "REJECT": "REJECT"
    },
    "loon": {
      "PROXY": "PROXY",
      "DIRECT": "DIRECT",
      "REJECT": "REJECT"
    },
    "openclash": {
      "PROXY": "🚀 手动选择",
      "DIRECT": "DIRECT",
      "REJECT": "REJECT"
    }
  },
  "_dropComment": "mihomo 不支持这些规则类型，转换时跳过并写进日志",
  "dropRuleTypes": [
    "USER-AGENT",
    "URL-REGEX",
    "IP-ASN",
    "AND",
    "OR",
    "NOT",
    "PROCESS-NAME",
    "GEOIP",
    "SRC-IP"
  ],
  "openclashInline": false
}
